Package: parseMetab
Type: Package
Title: Leverage proteomics/transcriptomics data, infer metabolic acitivity, perform differential analysis, and visualization.
Version: 1.0.0
Date: 2026-01-06
Author: YUAN LI
Maintainer: YUAN LI <yuan.li@nbis.se>
Description: Provides utilities to parse proteomics/transcriptomics data, infers sample-wise metabolic activities using either CellFie or KEGG metabolic pathway-based GSVA analysis. Also runs limma (optionally paired) differential testing on
metabolic activities and produces summary tables and visualizations.
License: GPL-3
Imports:
    dplyr,
    ggplot2,
    igraph,
    stringr,
    tidyr,
    ggraph,
    tibble,
    limma
    edgeR
    GSVA
    KEGGREST
    viridis
    matrixStats
    ggh4x
    pheatmap
    openxlsx
